e` remains.                                   |               |\\n101 146 |    | `remote/step.cljc`, `remote/async.cljc` and their tests.   |                                                              |               |\\n102 146 +----+------------------------------------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------+---------------+\\n103 146 | 5  | REPL as a service: `yin.repl.serve` and `connect` over     | `(connect \\\"daostream:ws://...\\\")` resolves to a remote        | clj cljs cljd |\\n104 146 |    | `requests` and `answers` reflections; delete               | descriptor pair; the demo REPLs work; `yin.repl.link` serves |               |\\n105 146 |    | `dao.stream.serving`, `dao.stream.rpc.ws`, the apply wire  | content through slice 4; `dao.stream.rpc` is reworked over   |               |\\n106 146 |    | envelope from `dao.stream.apply`; rework or retire         | reflections or retired in the same slice, because the apply  |               |\\n107 146 |    | `dao.stream.rpc`.                                          | envelope it requires is deleted here.                        |               |\\n108 146 +----+------------------------------------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------+---------------+\\n109 145 | 6  | UDP channel: `dao.stream.udp` with fragmentation keyed by  | The toy over UDP with a 48 KiB value (inside the default    | clj cljs cljd |\\n110 145 |    | attachment, address, direction and id; adapters            | 64 KiB maximum); loss injection recovers by resend;         |               |\\n111 145 |    | `src/clj/dao/stream/udp/jvm.clj`, `src/cljs/dao/           | oversize beyond the maximum answers `transport-error`       |               |\\n112 145 |    | stream/udp/node.cljs`, `src/cljd/dao/stream/udp/dart.cljd`.| with reason `oversize`.                                     |               |\\n113 146 +----+----------------------------------